      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اطغاهُ</span></b>  <i>It,</i> (i. e. wealth, S,) or <i>he,</i> (a man,
Msb,) <i>made him to exceed the just,</i> or <i>common,
limit</i> or <i>measure; to be excessive, immoderate,
inordinate,</i> or <i>exorbitant.</i> (S, Msb, K.)

